# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #fields: one place per name, no shadowing by depth inside one callable): a declaration in
# an inline body assigns that place. y is an int at the root and a size_t in the if body: one place cannot admit
# both, refused at the second -- a contradiction of the code itself, not a question about the data.
S:
    int: y 1
    if: y = 1
        size_t: y 5U
end: S
D:
    int: y 0
end: D
call: S D
return
